  "baseline_facts": [
    "The list has no server-side pagination, filtering, or sorting; the UI configures client-side table operations.",
    "PostgreSQL descending order places a null created_at before populated timestamps.",
    "A nullable subject is serialized through Django escape(None) as the string 'None'.",
    "A scoped message with no delivery transactions returns the same 404 response as an absent message.",
    "An owned message without delivery transactions remains visible in the list.",
    "An impersonated athlete cannot use a group reference to bypass association operation admission.",
    "The message models have no attachment fields."
  ]
